alling this done; it depends on the multi-threading baseline.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 35 slack thread benchmark result channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 08 11 last activ 2026 08 12 2026 08 11 08 42 evan the benchmark node final got provis rerun the script on real bare metal hardwar now instead of a stand in 2026 08 11 08 44 alic good time glad that block is clear 2026 08 11 08 47 evan full run is go should have result to share by tomorrow 2026 08 12 10 17 diana result are in sinc the multi thread work is alreadi done i use it a the baselin for comparison the number line up with what we expect from that work 2026 08 12 11 30 alic great are we publish these a the offici releas figur 2026 08 12 11 32 diana yes publish now call this done it depend on the multi thread baselin\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"eddf88928a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-11-benchmark-results.md\", \"id\": \"b60066731c7c5692\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3232114355100569, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.20478107644293841, \"vector_similarity\": 0.59954894, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-11-benchmark-results.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"eddf88928a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-11-benchmark-results.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-11-benchmark-results.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 880, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:15\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:08:48\", \"token_count\": 271, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-05\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Offset Mismatch Debugging\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-06-23\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 08:56] Charlie**: @Diana, I'm seeing weird behavior in the test cases. The redaction masks are shifted by a character or two in some PDF exports.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 09:01] Diana**: Multi-column layouts? I told you pdfminer output was injecting spaces.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 09:43] Charlie**: It's not just the spaces. The engine sees the text at one offset, but the PDF coordinates are different after the cleaning phase.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 10:51] Diana**: Are you seeing this on all viewers? Sometimes Acrobat renders overlays differently than Chrome's PDF viewer.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 10:52] Charlie**: Looking at the raw coordinate output for now. Whitespace normalization looks like the culprit — non-breaking spaces keep showing up in the extracted text.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 10:53] Charlie**: Still stuck. Tried mapping cleaned offsets back to raw ones, but the math falls apart on dense pages.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 12:40] Diana**: Can we get most of the standard text aligned and park the edge cases?\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 12:42] Charlie**: Not really — on dense docs it's closer to half the spans. Starting to look like an upstream pdfminer.six issue. I'm going to check their tracker.\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 12:45] Alice**: Status?\\n\\n**[2026-06-23 12:47] Charlie**: No. Offline tonight.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 05 slack thread offset mismatch debug channel cipherdoc date 2026 06 23 2026 06 23 08 56 charli diana i m see weird behavior in the test case the redact mask are shift by a charact or two in some pdf export 2026 06 23 09 01 diana multi column layout i told you pdfminer output wa inject space 2026 06 23 09 43 charli it s not just the space the engin see the text at one offset but the pdf coordin are differ after the clean phase 2026 06 23 10 51 diana are you see this on all viewer sometim acrobat render overlay differ than chrome s pdf viewer 2026 06 23 10 52 charli look at the raw coordin output for now whitespac normal look like the culprit non break space keep show up in the extract text 2026 06 23 10 53 charli still stuck tri map clean offset back to raw one but the math fall apart on dens page 2026 06 23 12 40 diana can we get most of the standard text align and park the edg case 2026 06 23 12 42 charli not realli on dens doc it s closer to half the span start to look like an upstream pdfminer six issu i m go to check their tracker 2026 06 23 12 45 alic status 2026 06 23 12 47 charli no offlin tonight\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee2707448a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-06-23-offset-bug-debug.md\", \"id\": \"30c128c9ab691c29\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.32258145351005685, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.20478107644293841, \"vector_similarity\": 0.597449, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-06-23-offset-bug-debug.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee2707448a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-06-23-offset-bug-debug.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-06-23-offset-bug-debug.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1387, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:15\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:07:41\", \"token_count\": 405, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-37\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Title**: Validate batch runs under a network-denied harness\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild a reproducible offline test harness that denies network access, then execute a full batch run under it to validate the strict air-gapped claim, depending on the completed AES-256 encryption pipeline. The offline batch run completed and was signed off, with a noted 45-second remote licence-check hang recorded; this sign-off is preliminary only and is not a compliance certification.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-37\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Title**: Validate batch runs under a network-denied harness\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Offline test harness reliably denies network access during a batch run.\\n\\n- Full batch executes successfully to completion under the harness with network blocked.\\n\\n- Sign-off explicitly notes it is preliminary and not a compliance certification, along with the observed licence-check hang.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-37\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Title**: Validate batch runs under a network-denied harness\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild a reproducible offline test harness that denies network access, then execute a full batch run under it to validate the strict air-gapped claim, depending on the completed AES-256 encryption pipeline. The offline batch run completed and was signed off, with a noted 45-second remote licence-check hang recorded; this sign-off is preliminary only and is not a compliance certification.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-37\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-37\\n\\n**Title**: Validate batch runs under a network-denied harness\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Activity Histo