}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-51\\n\\n# Slack Thread: CSV Dictionary Rule Test Notes\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-16\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-16 13:21] Diana**: Ran the rule test against the merged CSV dictionary — it's passing clean, including the terms layered on top of the HIPAA patterns.\\n\\n**[2026-08-16 13:47] Bob**: Good, and that's sitting on top of the financial-detection baseline. No regressions there?\\n\\n**[2026-08-16 14:13] Diana**: Confirmed — reran the financial-detection suite too, still green. Calling the CSV matcher rule test complete.\\n\\n**[2026-08-16 14:16] Alice**: Nice, thanks Diana. That closes out the dictionary matching piece.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 51 slack thread csv dictionari rule test note channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 16 2026 08 16 13 21 diana ran the rule test against the merg csv dictionari it s pass clean includ the term layer on top of the hipaa pattern 2026 08 16 13 47 bob good and that s sit on top of the financi detect baselin no regress there 2026 08 16 14 13 diana confirm reran the financi detect suit too still green call the csv matcher rule test complet 2026 08 16 14 16 alic nice thank diana that close out the dictionari match piec\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"edb0e4ce8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-16-csv-dictionary-notes.md\", \"id\": \"940624d5acdea2e9\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3289613045100569, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.20478107644293841, \"vector_similarity\": 0.61871517, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-16-csv-dictionary-notes.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"edb0e4ce8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-16-csv-dictionary-notes.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-16-csv-dictionary-notes.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 652, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:14\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:18\", \"token_count\": 204, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-29\\n\\n# Slack Thread: OCR Temp Cleanup Hooks\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Thread opened**: 2026-08-09\\n\\n**Last activity**: 2026-08-11\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 09:21] Charlie**: Cleanup hooks are in, covering both the failure path and the normal completion path — using the site inventory from the trace so nothing's left out.\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 09:36] Bob**: What happens if the process gets killed outright instead of failing cleanly?\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 09:39] Charlie**: Can't hook a hard kill directly, but between the failure hook and the completion hook we cover everything the OCR branch can reach on its own.\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 10:49] Diana**: I'll run it against the QA scenario that left orphaned files last week and see if it actually clears them.\\n\\n**[2026-08-11 09:09] Diana**: Confirmed — ran it through both the failure case and a normal completion, and the temp files are gone after each. No leftovers.\\n\\n**[2026-08-11 09:30] Charlie**: Good. Secure deletion confirmed — I'll close this out.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 29 slack thread ocr temp cleanup hook channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 08 09 last activ 2026 08 11 2026 08 09 09 21 charli cleanup hook are in cover both the failur path and the normal complet path use the site inventori from the trace so noth s left out 2026 08 09 09 36 bob what happen if the process get kill outright instead of fail clean 2026 08 09 09 39 charli can t hook a hard kill direct but between the failur hook and the complet hook we cover everyth the ocr branch can reach on it own 2026 08 09 10 49 diana i ll run it against the qa scenario that left orphan file last week and see if it actual clear them 2026 08 11 09 09 diana confirm ran it through both the failur case and a normal complet and the temp file are gone after each no leftov 2026 08 11 09 30 charli good secur delet confirm i ll close this out\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"edbfe9608a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-ocr-temp-cleanup-hooks.md\", \"id\": \"c2cece11a183981b\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3288703055100569, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.20478107644293841, \"vector_similarity\": 0.61841184, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-ocr-temp-cleanup-hooks.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"edbfe9608a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-ocr-temp-cleanup-hooks.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-ocr-temp-cleanup-hooks.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1012, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:14\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:16\", \"token_count\": 297, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-08\\n\\n# Slack Thread: API Authentication Deferral\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Thread opened**: 2026-06-28\\n\\n**Last activity**: 2026-08-20\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-06-28 13:07] Bob**: Looking into REST API auth for v1.0. Do we need a full auth story now, or is trusted local network enough for the first release?\\n\\n**[2026-06-28 13:22] Diana**: Given the PII involved, something robust would be nice. B