\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3178245462416815, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.120176466059545, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7790034, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee7fcda28a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1197, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:06:21\", \"token_count\": 534, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-29\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Title**: Offline auth with key rotation for air-gapped installs\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-01\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nProvide offline-mode authentication for air-gapped deployments, including a key-rotation flow that doesn't assume an always-on network. Testing against a local auth mock showed that key rotation cannot complete without network access in an air-gapped setting, and the task remains blocked with no resolution yet.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-29\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-29\\n\\n**Title**: Offline auth with key rotation for air-gapped installs\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-01\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Authentication works fully offline for air-gapped deployment scenarios.\\n\\n- Key-rotation flow completes without requiring network access.\\n\\n- Blocking issue (rotation dependent on network) is resolved before the task can close.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task